    "A good start." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Awal yang bagus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A key with no sensor? Choose “No sensor on key …”. Its hits can't be heard, so its notes count as missed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ada bilah tanpa sensor? Pilih “Bilah … tanpa sensor”. Pukulannya tidak terdengar, jadi not di bilah itu dihitung meleset."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A kotekan is a line too fast to play alone, so it is split. Neither part is the tune. The tune is what you hear when both are going." : {
      "comment" : "Explainer content for \"Kotekan\" (.kotekan guide).",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kotekan adalah jalinan nada yang terlalu cepat untuk dimainkan sendirian, jadi dibagi dua. Masing-masing bagian belum jadi melodi. Melodinya baru muncul saat keduanya dimainkan bersama."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A shared kotekan is a link to your account. Link an Apple ID and anyone with the link can add a copy to their gangsa." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kotekan yang dibagikan terhubung ke akunmu. Hubungkan Apple ID, lalu siapa pun yang punya tautannya bisa menambahkan salinannya ke gangsa mereka."
          }
        }
      }
    },
